<section class="py-36" id="testimonials">
	<div class="container px-4 mx-auto">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 lg:mb-16 text-center">
			<h2
				class="mb-4 text-3xl leading-tight md:text-4xl md:leading-tight lg:text-5xl lg:leading-tight font-bold font-headings">
				Here From My Clients
			</h2>
			<p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed lg:text-xl lg:leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				We have a pretty good time over here, building and designing websites that work just as hard as you do.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap items-stretch justify-around -m-4">
			<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3 p-4">
				<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-ccGreen h-full flex flex-col">
					<div class="flex-grow overflow-auto testimonial-content">
						<p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed lg:text-xl lg:leading-relaxed text-gray-50">
							"Camille took care of everything for us. I have no idea how to get a website up and running, and I didn't
							want to be responsible trying to make my website look good. She even hooked up my domain name and email! I
							just had to tell her what I wanted, and she made it happen."
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-auto">
						<p class="text-2xl font-bold font-headings">Ken</p>
						<p class="text-lg text-gray-50">KRB Development Enterprise</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3 p-4">
				<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-ccYellow h-full flex flex-col">
					<div class="flex-grow overflow-auto testimonial-content">
						<p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed lg:text-xl lg:leading-relaxed text-gray-50">
							"I needed a website to collect leads and store it in a google spreadsheet I had set up. She automated
							everything, and now my workflow is smooth."
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-auto">
						<p class="text-2xl font-bold font-headings">David</p>
						<p class="text-lg text-gray-50">Final Frontier</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3 p-4">
				<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-ccBlue h-full flex flex-col">
					<div class="flex-grow overflow-auto testimonial-content">
						<p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed lg:text-xl lg:leading-relaxed text-gray-50">
							"If you want something that stands out she's your girl. I have a website that looks good and I can upload
							any video I want to showcase on it. Thats everything I needed."
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-auto">
						<p class="text-2xl font-bold font-headings">Kenny</p>
						<p class="text-lg text-gray-50">II Efficient Media</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3 p-4"></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	/* Set a fixed height for testimonial cards on desktop */
	@media (min-width: 1024px) {
		.testimonial-content {
			min-height: 200px; /* Adjust this value as needed */
			max-height: 200px; /* Makes all cards the same height */
		}
	}

	/* Optional: Add custom scrollbar styling */
	.testimonial-content::-webkit-scrollbar {
		width: 4px;
	}

	.testimonial-content::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border-radius: 10px;
	}

	.testimonial-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
		border-radius: 10px;
	}

	.testimonial-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
	}
</style>
